<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT POLAND 4-2 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT POLAND 4-2 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>GOIANIA, Brazil 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil beat Poland 4-2</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0) in a friendly soccer international on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Brazil - Giovanni (8th and 27th minutes), Ronaldo (48th,</p>
<p>72nd)</p>
<p>Poland - Cezary Kucharski (87th), Marek Citko (90th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 65,000</p>
</text>
